Dear parish families,

Delphine Arkwright retired at the end of May after eleven years with us. Please join me in welcoming Nadia Pemberton, who began on June 15 as our new director of religious education.

Nadia comes to us from a parish in Wexley County, where she led youth ministry. Her office is next to the Kerrigan Room.

Fr. Anselm
